(7103294, 1082680, 12611, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel, the glint of light on tomato two, the digital moire feel of the stem. Low light digital has a great way of appearing like the shadowy still life paintings of the masters, with the added kick of alien saturation. Even the awkward crop eventually grew on me. 8</td>', 'I really like the feel, the glint of light on tomato two, the digital moire feel of the stem. Low light digital has a great way of appearing like the shadowy still life paintings of the masters, with the added kick of alien saturation. Even the awkward crop eventually grew on me. 8', '2013-09-16 09:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
